{"message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005, per post_text q11. The change from 2005 to 2006 is 10 - 4 = 6 million USD, an increase.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"10 - 4","variables":{"2006_reserve":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"2005_reserve":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"2006_reserve":"source:q11n3","2005_reserve":"source:q11n4"}}}